# The API is not deployed to Vercel. In a split deploy it runs on Render/Railway/Fly
# and Vercel only ever builds frontend/. Excluding the backend keeps the upload
# small and stops the Python toolchain from being installed for nothing.
#
# For the single-container deploy there is no Vercel step at all — one process
# serves both the API and the built site. See README "Deploying".
backend
Dockerfile
fly.toml
.dockerignore
.env.production.example
scripts

# Documentation is not part of the site.
*.md
!README.md